{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17107300","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17107300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710730001:1":{"text":"하암... 방금 잠들었는데요...","source_cn":"唔……我才刚睡着……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE6299C12DB5CCEDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710730002:1":{"text":"쉬시는 데 죄송해요, 아로라 님. 부디 무례를 용서해 주시길.","source_cn":"非常抱歉，奥萝菈冕下。请恕我们冒昧，在这个时间打扰您的安眠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x554630F6780542AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710730003:1":{"text":"으음? 못 보던 아이네요.","source_cn":"咦？没见过的孩子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAE5A8A0FB9F0F7E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710730004:1":{"text":"전 귀네스라고 합니다. 그러니까...","source_cn":"在下名为格温妮丝，是因为……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96968744076BE6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1710730004":{"text":"전 귀네스라고 합니다. 그러니까...","source_cn":"在下名为格温妮丝，是因为……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96968744076BE6A3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710730005:1":